            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setup link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something went wrong. Open the link in your email again." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the first-run screen when the answer from Tabsend's own hosted service could not be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Etwas ist schiefgelaufen. Öffne den Link in deiner E-Mail erneut."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Something went wrong. Open the link in your email again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs arrive while Tabsend is open, or when you open it. iOS may also wake it in the background." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the Privacy section in Settings on a phone Tabsend can't wake. iOS is Apple's phone system.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabs kommen an, solange Tabsend geöffnet ist oder wenn du die App öffnest. iOS kann die App auch im Hintergrund aufwecken."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabs arrive while Tabsend is open, or when you open it. iOS may also wake it in the background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs normally reach this phone right away, even when Tabsend is closed. To do that, Tabsend's wake-up service asks Apple to wake the phone." : {
      "comment" : "Info sheet for the switch \"Only get tabs when Tabsend is open\", first paragraph.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabs erreichen dieses Smartphone normalerweise sofort, auch wenn Tabsend geschlossen ist. Dafür bittet der Weckdienst von Tabsend Apple, das Smartphone aufzuwecken."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabs normally reach this phone right away, even when Tabsend is closed. To do that, Tabsend's wake-up service asks Apple to wake the phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs you send and tabs that arrive show up here." : {
      "comment" : "Shown on Home in place of the Latest cards before any tab has moved.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gesendete und angekommene Tabs erscheinen hier."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabs you send and tabs that arrive show up here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabsend only opens HTTP and HTTPS links." : {
      "comment" : "Notification body under \"Unsupported link blocked\". HTTP and HTTPS are the two kinds of web address Tabsend opens.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabsend öffnet nur HTTP- und HTTPS-Links."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabsend only opens HTTP and HTTPS links."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That QR code isn't a Tabsend pairing code." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the first-run screen after scanning a QR code that is not a Tabsend pairing code.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser QR-Code ist kein Tabsend-Kopplungscode."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That QR code isn't a Tabsend pairing code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That device isn't in your group any more." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the History screen after Send again, when the device the tab was meant for has left the group.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Gerät ist nicht mehr in deiner Gruppe."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That device isn't in your group any more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That sign-in link has expired or was already used. Set up an account again to get a new one." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the first-run screen when the sign-in link from the email is too old (it lasts 15 minutes) or was already used.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Anmeldelink ist abgelaufen oder wurde schon verwendet. Richte das Konto noch einmal ein, um einen neuen zu erhalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That sign-in link has expired or was already used. Set up an account again to get a new one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code works once and expires in 10 minutes." : {
      "comment" : "Third line in the \"How pairing works\" sheet on the first-run screen, next to a clock icon. The pairing code is valid for exactly 10 minutes by default.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Code funktioniert nur einmal und läuft nach 10 Minuten ab."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The code works once and expires in 10 minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are still on this phone. Each one sends itself as soon as your relay answers again. Swipe a tab away to stop waiting for it." : {
      "comment" : "Note under the list of tabs that are waiting on this phone because the relay (the server that passes tabs between devices) is not answering.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Tabs sind noch auf diesem Smartphone. Jeder wird automatisch gesendet, sobald dein Relay wieder antwortet. Wische einen Tab weg, um nicht mehr darauf zu warten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These are still on this phone. Each one sends itself as soon as your relay answers again. Swipe a tab away to stop waiting for it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They learn that this phone received something, and when, and Apple also sees its internet address. They never learn what was sent or who sent it." : {
      "comment" : "Info sheet for the switch \"Only get tabs when Tabsend is open\", second paragraph. They means the wake-up service and Apple. Keep exactly what each one learns.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beide erfahren, dass dieses Smartphone etwas erhalten hat, und wann. Apple sieht außerdem die Internetadresse des Smartphones. Was gesendet wurde und von wem, erfahren beide nie."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They learn that this phone received something, and when, and Apple also sees its internet address. They never learn what was sent or who sent it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account already has a device. On a paired device, choose Add a device, then scan its code here." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the first-run screen after the sign-in link from the email was used for an account that already has a device. The setup link only exists while the account's group is empty, so this phone is added from a paired device instead.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Konto hat bereits ein Gerät. Wähle auf einem gekoppelten Gerät „Gerät hinzufügen“ und scanne dann dessen Code hier."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This account already has a device. On a paired device, choose Add a device, then scan its code here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ends any plan without a refund, deletes your group and unpairs every device. You finish on tabsend.org." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the Delete account confirmation. A plan is the paid or trial time on the account. The group is the set of devices that send to each other. Keep the web address unchanged.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das beendet einen laufenden Tarif ohne Rückerstattung, löscht deine Gruppe und hebt die Kopplung aller Geräte auf. Abschließen kannst du auf tabsend.org."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This ends any plan without a refund, deletes your group and unpairs every device. You finish on tabsend.org."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone" : {
      "comment" : "Settings: label of the row showing this phone's device name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Smartphone"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today" : {
      "comment" : "Heading above History rows from today. One word.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heute"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on if you don't want to be tracked this way. You'll see each site's first letter instead." : {
      "comment" : "Info sheet for the switch \"Don't load website images\", last paragraph.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schalte das ein, wenn du auf diese Weise nicht verfolgt werden möchtest. Stattdessen siehst du den ersten Buchstaben jeder Website."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn this on if you don't want to be tracked this way. You'll see each site's first letter instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on if you'd rather not share that. Tabs will then arrive when you open Tabsend." : {
      "comment" : "Info sheet for the switch \"Only get tabs when Tabsend is open\", last paragraph.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schalte das ein, wenn du das lieber nicht teilen möchtest. Tabs kommen dann an, wenn du Tabsend öffnest."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn this on if you'd rather not share that. Tabs will then arrive when you open Tabsend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpair" : {
      "comment" : "Row in Settings, and button in its confirmation dialog. Unlinks this phone from the group. Keep it short.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kopplung aufheben"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unpair"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpair this phone? Links already on other devices stay there." : {
      "comment" : "Title of the confirmation dialog for Unpair. \"Links\" are the tabs that were already sent.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kopplung dieses Smartphones aufheben? Links, die schon auf anderen Geräten sind, bleiben dort."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unpair this phone? Links already on other devices stay there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsupported link blocked" : {
      "comment" : "Notification title when a tab arrived whose address is not a web address (not http or https), so Tabsend will not open it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nicht unterstützter Link blockiert"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unsupported link blocked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses Tabsend's service: free for 14 days, no card needed, paid after that." : {
      "comment" : "Small line under the Set up an account button on the first-run screen, US App Store only. Tabsend's service is the server Tabsend runs for people. Says what the account is and that it costs money after the trial. No price.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nutzt den Dienst von Tabsend: 14 Tage kostenlos, keine Karte nötig, danach kostenpflichtig."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uses Tabsend's service: free for 14 days, no card needed, paid after that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you copied isn't a Tabsend setup link." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the first-run screen after Paste, when the text on the clipboard is not a setup link. A setup link is the pairing link another device shows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was du kopiert hast, ist kein Tabsend-Einrichtungslink."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you copied isn't a Tabsend setup link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday" : {
      "comment" : "Heading above History rows from yesterday. One word.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gestern"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yesterday"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change it later in Tabsend." : {
      "comment" : "Small line under the name field on the Name this phone screen. Tabsend is the app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst ihn später in Tabsend ändern."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can change it later in Tabsend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your devices" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the home-screen section that lists the devices in the group.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Geräte"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your devices"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay is older than group history, so it keeps no record of what was sent. Sending and receiving work normally. Update the relay to see this screen fill in." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the empty History screen when the relay (the server that passes tabs between devices) is too old to keep a history. Nothing is wrong with the phone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Relay ist zu alt für den Gruppenverlauf und speichert daher nicht, was gesendet wurde. Senden und Empfangen funktionieren normal. Aktualisiere das Relay, damit sich dieser Bildschirm füllt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your relay is older than group history, so it keeps no record of what was sent. Sending and receiving work normally. Update the relay to see this screen fill in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone" : {
      "comment" : "Name of this phone in the group when iOS gives it no name of its own. It fills the name box on the first-run screen, is shown as the example in the empty box, and the person keeps it as the device's name. Product name: normally stays \"iPhone\"; translate only if the language has another usual way to name a phone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this phone" : {
      "comment" : "Replaces the status of the device list row that is this phone: \"iPhone · this phone\". Lowercase, short.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "dieses Smartphone"
          }
